### Compliance Reporting

**Generate monthly report**:
```bash
# List all keys with ages
for user in $(aws iam list-users --query 'Users[].UserName' --output text --profile {{stage}}); do
  echo "User: $user"
  aws iam list-access-keys --user-name "$user" --profile {{stage}} | \
    jq -r '.AccessKeyMetadata[] | "\(.AccessKeyId): \(.CreateDate) (Age: \((now - (.CreateDate | fromdateiso8601)) / 86400 | floor) days)"'
